  "sections": {
    "starterStories": {
      "body": "The current source configuration assigns the Imperial starter pool to SoA_SardaukarTrooper, SoA_ImperialOfficer, SoA_SardaukarElite, SoA_HouseFactor, and SoA_CHOAMFactor. Its childhood stories are garrison street child (SoA_Bio_Imperial_UrbworldUrchin61), household observer (SoA_Bio_Imperial_ChildSpy47), and quartermaster child (SoA_Bio_Imperial_ShopKid36); adult stories are garrison enforcer (SoA_Bio_Imperial_Policeman45), House clerk (SoA_Bio_Imperial_CivilServant2), and Imperial assault veteran (SoA_Bio_Imperial_SpaceMarine16). The 18 authored stories retain their selected Core template mechanics; this pool changes which stories newly generated owned pawns may draw from, not their skill rules. The category patch does not migrate biographies already stored in saves. This is a bounded starter pool, not a claim that every pawn of this culture uses these stories."
    }
  },
